  volume       = {203},
  pages        = {74--80},
  date         = {2018-04},
  abstract     = {BACKGROUND: Analyzing Body Mass Index as a didactical example,
                  the study by Evans, Williams, Onnela, and Subramanian (EWOS
                  study) introduce a novel methodology for the investigation of
                  socioeconomic disparities in health. By using multilevel
